{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1507939-how-well-known-is-sorcery-in-your-world","id":1507939,"title":"How well known is Sorcery in your World?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","Scion"],"posts":[{"date":"2023-04-10T08:41:16-07:00","id":1507939,"title":"How well known is Sorcery in your World?","content":"How are Sorcery and Sorcerers viewed in your versions of the World? How well known are they? How overt are Sorcerers with their abilities? Are there laws about magic? Witch hunts? Secret Magic schools? Sorcery courses at college? Witch Pride parades? Military Sorcerers?<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>When will you rage?","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1405-anteros","name":"Anteros","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1405_4.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"661"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-10T09:28:43-07:00","id":1507941,"title":"","content":"I would think it would depend on what part of the world you are in, with different societies having different views of sorcerers and different support systems for training them.<br /> <br /> Sam van Schaik's <i>Buddhist Magic: Divination, Healing, and Enchantment Through the Ages</i> documents that, in the real world, what Scion would call sorcery was pretty common. Many Buddhist sutras (scriptures) contain directions for magical spells and, in many communities, monks and nuns were expected to work magic on behalf of the community.<br /> <br /> I would expect the same would true in Scion, with the sorcery having a much more visible impact than it does in ours.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\u